  "question": {
    "text": "The value of $\\cos 255^{\\circ}+\\sin 195^{\\circ}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "omJgZ",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2 \\sqrt{2}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hJEJk",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{\\sqrt{2}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "muyQW",
      "text": "\n$-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{\\sqrt{2}}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ylJMy",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}+1}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Consider $\\cos 255^{\\circ}+\\sin 195^{\\circ}$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& =\\cos \\left(270^{\\circ}-15^{\\circ}\\right)+\\sin \\left(180^{\\circ}+15^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\\n& =-\\sin 15^{\\circ}-\\sin 15^{\\circ} \\\\\n& =-2 \\sin 15^{\\circ}=-2\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{2 \\sqrt{2}}\\right)=-\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}-1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
